resources.string:
"★ Daily acceptance has a powerful custom function, and users can customize the combination of question types in the practice library, and perform random self-tests;
★ If you exit halfway to the function, we will save today's breakpoints for you, so you can enter again to continue the practice;
★ Once you start your daily acceptance plan, you can only modify your the plan the next day. You can only do it once a day."

"1. The overall completion is good, 2 points of the content has obtained; There is inappropriate pauses before the words of ‘should', 'readers' and 'attention', and the word of 'should' was pronounced as 'will';
2. ‘s’ sound of sentences has omitted.
3. The speed is a little slow and your voice is not aloud enough. In addition, speaking at a natural rate; producing fluent speech; using correct intonation; using correct pronunciation; using correct stress; speaking under timed conditions."
